export function UploadPhotos({value,onChange,endpoint='/api/catalog'}:{value:string[];onChange:(v:string[])=>void;endpoint?:string}){const [busy,setBusy]=useState(false),[error,setError]=useState('');async function upload(files:FileList|null){if(!files)return;setBusy(true);setError('');const added=[...value];try{for(const file of Array.from(files).slice(0,5-value.length)){if(file.size>5*1024*1024)throw new Error('Каждое фото должно быть меньше 5 МБ');const r=await fetch(endpoint,{method:'PUT',headers:{'Content-Type':file.type},body:file});const b=await r.json() as {error:string;url:string};if(!r.ok)throw new Error(b.error);added.push(b.url);onChange([...added]);}}catch(e){setError((e as Error).message)}finally{setBusy(false)}}return <div><label className="d-upload"><Upload size={28}/><b>{busy?'Загружаем фотографии…':'Добавьте фотографии'}</b><span>До 5 фото · JPG, PNG, WebP · до 5 МБ каждое</span><input disabled={busy||value.length>=5} type="file" multiple accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" onChange={e=>void upload(e.target.files)}/></label><div className="ng-uploaded">{value.map((v,i)=><div key={v}><Image src={v} alt={`Фото ${i+1}`}/><button type="button" onClick={()=>onChange(value.filter(x=>x!==v))}>Удалить</button></div>)}</div>{error&&<p role="alert" className="ng-error">{error}</p>}</div>}
